      {
        "text": "The bakery's only industrial oven's controller board failed and required repair to be delivered to Birmingham.",
        "citations": [
          "F1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The bakery booked SwiftHaul's guaranteed next-day delivery online describing the parcel as 'electronic component' and did not disclose inability to trade without the part.",
        "citations": [
          "F2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The bakery accepted SwiftHaul's terms including an exclusion clause limiting liability for loss of profits arising from delay.",
        "citations": [
          "F3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "SwiftHaul mistakenly sent the parcel to the wrong depot resulting in an eleven-day delay in delivery.",
        "citations": [
          "F4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The bakery lost ordinary trade profits of about \u00a318,000 and a \u00a340,000 one-off wedding contract due to inability to bake for twelve days.",
        "citations": [
          "F5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "SwiftHaul contends it did not foresee the bakery's inability to trade or the exceptional nature of the wedding contract and relies on the exclusion clause to exclude these losses.",
        "citations": [
          "F6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The bakery seeks damages for breach of contract covering lost profits and lost contract due to delayed delivery.",
